<title>USA: Biomagnetic delisted from Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Biomagnetic delisted from Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biomagnetic Technologies Inc said Wednesday it had been delisted by the Nasdaq National Market because it is unable to meet the criteria requiring companies to have at least $4 million in net tangible assets.</p>
<p>The company said the delisting was effective March 10. It said it expects to be traded in the OTC market.</p>
<p>The company develops Magnetic Source Imaging for research and clinical applications.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
